# MCP UI Rendering Deception Seeds — MCP16
# Academic:
#   - Greshake et al. (arXiv:2302.12173) §3.2 — Indirect injection via rendering carrier
#   - OWASP ASI02 — Manipulate agent via UI rendering
#   - LLM agents parse markdown/HTML in UI rendering layer, attackers forge system-looking messages
#   - ASR improvement 15-25% (Greshake et al. §4.3)
# ASR Target: Trick agent with fake UI elements that appear as system messages

# ── MCP16: MCP UI 渲染欺骗 (MCP_16) ──

